1149 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1054 0 R
/E (Multi-Line Insurance Policy and Claims Management System is designed to provide a centralized Salesforce-based solution for managing Vehicle, Property, and Life Insurance policies and claims. The system enables insurance agents to create and manage policy information using a flexible data model with policy-specific Record Types and Field Sets. Guided Screen Flows simplify policy quoting, while Apex automation calculates premiums based on policy and vehicle details. Claims are automatically routed to the appropriate queue based on policy type, and high-value claims are processed through an approval workflow involving Senior Adjusters and Claims Managers. An LWC-based Claims Dashboard provides adjusters with a focused view of their assigned claims, including claim amount, policy type, policy holder, status, and days open. This initiative improves policy processing efficiency, claim handling, data accuracy, operational visibility, and customer service. )
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
