/S /P
/P 1055 0 R
/E (For claims adjusters, an LWC-based Claims Dashboard provides visibility into assigned claims, including claim number, policy type, policy holder, claim amount, approval status, and days open. High-value claims exceeding the defined threshold are processed through a structured approval workflow involving Senior Adjusters and Claims Managers. Security and access are managed using sharing rules and role-specific Permission Sets. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
1159 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1055 0 R
/E (Overall, the project provides a centralized platform for improving policy processing, premium calculation, claim routing, claim approval, data accuracy, operational visibility, and customer service across multiple insurance lines. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
