1161 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1055 0 R
/E (The purpose of the Multi-Line Insurance Policy and Claims Management System is to provide a centralized Salesforce-based platform for managing Vehicle, Property, and Life Insurance policies and claims. The system is designed to overcome the limitations of legacy processes that result in manual, slow, and inconsistent quoting, policy issuance, and claims handling. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
1162 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1055 0 R
/E (The solution aims to standardize and accelerate policy quoting and issuance, automate claim initiation and routing based on policy type and claim severity, and provide a 360-degree view of Customer, Policy, and Claim information. It also supports guided quoting through Screen Flows, automated premium and claim processing, data validation, and an LWC-based dashboard to improve claims adjuster efficiency. )
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
