2929 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1145 0 R
/E (The Multi-Line Insurance Policy and Claims Management System provides a centralized Salesforce-based solution for managing Vehicle, Property, and Life Insurance policies and claims. The project addresses the limitations of manual and fragmented processes by introducing guided quoting, automated premium calculation, claim routing, structured approval processes, and an LWC-based Claims Dashboard. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
2930 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1145 0 R
/E (Overall, the project demonstrates how Salesforce can bring multiple insurance processes together on a single scalable platform, helping insurance teams work more efficiently while providing better visibility and service to customers. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
2931 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 1145 0 R
/E (The solution uses a combination of Salesforce Flows, Apex, Record Types, Field Sets, Validation Rules, Approval Processes, LWC, Permission Sets, and Sharing Rules to improve policy processing, claim handling, data accuracy, security, and operational visibility. )
/Pg 101 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
